{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《自然》雜誌19日發表的一項最新研究，天文學家利用詹姆斯·韋布空間望遠鏡，首次直接追蹤到恆星「吃掉」同類過程：兩顆恆星旋近進入共有包層階段，隨後劇烈爆發。這一名為AT 2025abao的事件，為理解緊密恆星系統的形成與其他能量劇烈的天文事件提供了重要依據。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587650.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.503659+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:07:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_hash":"de14cabb8f15494ee39d4e1f27033197d7c65e286e86721911efc4b8145c6b7a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}